{"2401740": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "​Shattered Lands (破碎之地)", "steam_appid": 2401740, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First and foremost, this is an exceptionally content-rich game that seamlessly integrates three entirely distinct gameplay modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In ​Survivor Mode, players can choose from nearly ​220 distinct skills to create exhilarating combat combinations, paired with approximately ​100,000 affixes that deliver a loot-driven experience rivaling Diablo's signature itemization depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2401740/extras/ecd0e19bbc16551460ecb740cdc7e4db.avif?t=1752315207\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2401740/extras_big/ecd0e19bbc16551460ecb740cdc7e4db.avif?t=1752315207 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2401740/extras/a409b24fa5b5b52dd1b4817ce2b2b523.avif?t=1752315207\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2401740/extras_big/a409b24fa5b5b52dd1b4817ce2b2b523.avif?t=1752315207 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2401740/extras/dcc3c1084ab9ce7c9b7dfe6aac0f1a61.avif?t=1752315207\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2401740/extras_big/dcc3c1084ab9ce7c9b7dfe6aac0f1a61.avif?t=1752315207 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ​Auto Chess Mode revolutionizes tactical gameplay with ​70 innovative skill sets (totaling 280 abilities), enabling ​thousands of character-specific synergies. Enhanced by deep equipment customization and affix systems, this mode achieves unprecedented strategic variety – our ultimate ambition is to craft a competitive experience on par with Teamfight Tactics (TFT).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2401740/extras/a638a47d69a7281f8179c947a6803a1d.avif?t=1752315207\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2401740/extras_big/a638a47d69a7281f8179c947a6803a1d.avif?t=1752315207 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2401740/extras/09fde8b9335e0b3f204375b8bd6b70f8.avif?t=1752315207\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2401740/extras_big/09fde8b9335e0b3f204375b8bd6b70f8.avif?t=1752315207 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story Mode offers world exploration, character development, dungeon crawling, loot farming, and craftable legendary gear – all woven into a cohesive RPG journey. In this mode, delivering a true-to-tabletop experience is where developer efforts are focused.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2401740/extras/7e27b29c167c61063208f4ea221173d8.avif?t=1752315207\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2401740/extras_big/7e27b29c167c61063208f4ea221173d8.avif?t=1752315207 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2401740/extras/fb76b8982cf46fbd0f40f498ebb322b8.avif?