=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ​Auto Chess Mode revolutionizes tactical gameplay with ​70 innovative skill sets (totaling 280 abilities), enabling ​thousands of character-specific synergies. Enhanced by deep equipment customization and affix systems, this mode achieves unprecedented strategic variety – our ultimate ambition is to craft a competitive experience on par with Teamfight Tactics (TFT).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2401740/extras/a638a47d69a7281f8179c947a6803a1d.avif?t=1752315207\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2401740/extras_big/a638a47d69a7281f8179c947a6803a1d.avif?t=1752315207 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2401740/extras/09fde8b9335e0b3f204375b8bd6b70f8.avif?t=1752315207\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2401740/extras_big/09fde8b9335e0b3f204375b8bd6b70f8.avif?t=1752315207 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story Mode offers world exploration, character development, dungeon crawling, loot farming, and craftable legendary gear – all woven into a cohesive RPG journey. In this mode, delivering a true-to-tabletop experience is where developer efforts are focused.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2401740/extras/7e27b29c167c61063208f4ea221173d8.avif?t=1752315207\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2401740/extras_big/7e27b29c167c61063208f4ea221173d8.avif?t=1752315207 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >